{"name":"Snowcap","hex":"#dce5eb","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"snowcap","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A layer of snow covering a mountain top.","A small hummingbird, Microchera albocoronata, which is a resident breeder in Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica and western Panama."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/snowcap"}],"entries":[{"title":"Snowcap","blocks":[{"text":"The snowcap is a species of hummingbird in the \"emeralds\", tribe Trochilini of subfamily Trochilinae. It is found in Costa Rica, Honduras, Nicaragua, and Panama."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Snowcap_%28Microchera_albocoronata%29.jpg/330px-Snowcap_%28Microchera_albocoronata%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snowcap","wikidata":"Q524681"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg/500px-Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg/1280px-Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg/500px-Female_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFemale_Snowcap_Hummingbird.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Snowcap_2.jpg/500px-Snowcap_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Snowcap_2.jpg/500px-Snowcap_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Snowcap (male)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/